{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And you shall place, before the parochet.</b> Outside." "<b>Before the kapporet.</b> That it be positioned opposite it."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {0 "The comment is laconic: Ibn Ezra notes that the golden altar stands outside (i.e., on the sanctuary side of) the parochet, the veil separating the Holy from the Holy of Holies. No expansion added."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:17.951705968Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}